{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prologue:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up from a nightmare, I saw only a stranger's face in the mirror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The echo of her faded skirt lingered clearly in my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Will the music box's melody help me find my love? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Control:</strong> Puzzle with just a click of the mouse. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scene Exploration:</strong> Find the scene exit to advance the plot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Branching Endings:</strong> Certain actions may affect the ending. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pencil Drawing Style:</strong>\u00a0To enter a dark fairytale world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scene Narrative:</strong> Piece together the story behind each scene from the details. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secret Collectibles:</strong> Collecting small hidden items may influence the final outcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747880?t=1754294617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747880?t=1754294617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747880/bdc4b42bf44d3ea3c249dbaceda3920bc850a00c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754294617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747880/bdc4b42bf44d3ea3c249dbaceda3920bc850a00c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754294617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"note